  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: e75725e3-c131-44bc-b36f-ec1965414d38
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • East region leads with $45,634 in Nov 2024, significantly outperforming other regions
        • November 2024 achieved highest monthly sales at $118,448 across all regions
        • Strong seasonal performance pattern with Dec 2023 ($96,999) and Sep 2021 ($81,777) as top months
        • Regional performance varies significantly, with East consistently stronger than Central

        Recommendations:
        • Investigate East region's success strategies for replication in underperforming Central region
        • Capitalize on November seasonal trends with targeted campaigns in Oct-Nov timeframe
